# GLM, EnTT, enkiTS and SPIRV-Reflect currently come from complete upstream archives.
# These entries declare submodule paths/URLs; gitlink registration is not performed here.
# Ordinary source files are ignored; acquisition facts remain in Dependencies.lock.json.

# Asset import dependencies above are user-provided directories; no gitlink registration or acquisition audit was performed.
# ImGuizmo is user-provided; only the compiled header/source and LICENSE were compared with upstream.
# Its path/URL declaration does not register a gitlink or stage the ignored source tree.
# Authoring dependencies are user-provided. Lua uses the official release's src/ layout;
# its upstream Git mirror keeps sources at the root, and Premake accepts both layouts.

# User-provided S14-S17 directories; declarations do not register gitlinks.
[submodule "Catalpa/third_party/meshoptimizer"]
